          alt: 'Mei Tanaka',
        },
        bio: 'Sed porttitor est nibh at nulla. Cras semper nulla leo, eget laoreet erat.',
        socials: [{ icon: 'tabler:brand-dribbble', href: 'https://dribbble.com/', ariaLabel: 'Dribbble' }],
      },
      {
        name: 'Jonas Weber',
